           <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
         </button>
         <div class="details" id="faq-2" hidden>
           <p>
             Purring often signals comfort, but cats may also purr when they want attention, feel nervous,
             or are soothing themselves. Context matters, so body language helps explain what the purr means.
           </p>
         </div>
       </div>

